<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-043" chapter-id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi" source-id="s-liangshu-043-jiangzisi-ws2087360">
  <p id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">弟<persName id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0001" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB">子四</persName>，歷尚書金部郎。大同初，遷右丞。兄弟性並剛烈。<persName id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0026" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB">子四</persName>自右丞上封事，極言得失，高祖甚善之，詔尚書詳擇施行焉。左民郎<persName id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0058" ref="j6f_ufq_av2_AA">沈炯</persName>、少府丞<persName id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0064" ref="ogc_45x_ckt">顧璵</persName>嘗奏事不允，高祖厲色呵責之；<persName id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0080" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB">子四</persName>乃趨前代<persName id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0086" ref="j6f_ufq_av2_AA">炯</persName>等對，言甚激切，高祖怒呼縛之，<persName id="c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0102" ref="z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB">子四</persName>據地不受，高祖怒亦止，乃釋之。猶坐免職。</p>
</text>
